  "description": "<p>Welcome to The Zenco USA Affiliate Program.&nbsp; Zenco USA is a proud partner of TheZenco (HQ in Canada) and proudly serves the kind people of the USA (and sometimes beyond).&nbsp; &nbsp;We are easy to work with, ship super fast, and take a lot of pride in delivering exceptional customer service....especially to our affiliate partners.&nbsp; If we can go the extra mile for you - we'll run at a sub 7-minute pace!&nbsp;<br><br></p>\r\n<p>Currently, Zenco units come in the Onyx and Wood colors in both the Duo and the Flow models.&nbsp; Note the Zenco base unit is the same on the Duo and the Flow.&nbsp; The difference in the glass setup is as follows:&nbsp; &nbsp;<br><br>The Duo offers 2 drinkable vapor glasses, where you knock em back like a cold brew (or wine for you more sophisticated vapor mavens).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The Flow offers 1 double-stack bubbler glass, which is great for softening up the vapor delivery (i.e. less harsh when filtered through H20).&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The easy way to remember it:&nbsp; You <em><strong>sip the Duo</strong></em> and you <em><strong>rip the Flow</strong></em>.</p>\r\n<p>One of the more popular packages we offer is where you buy a Zenco Duo or Flow and add-on the extra glass (i.e. Zenco Duo + Flow glass).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>If you a dabbster, make sure you recommend adding on some extra ceramic coils - well worth the extra few dollars.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
